   "id": 614048,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "A battery of unknown voltage <span data-math=\"V_1\">V_1</span> is attached across a resistor <span data-math=\"R_1\">R_1</span>. You add a second battery with <span data-math=\"V_2 = 9.0\\,\\text{V}\">V_2 = 9.0\\,\\text{V}</span> in series with <span data-math=\"V_1\">V_1</span> so that the voltage across <span data-math=\"R_1\">R_1</span> is now <span data-math=\"V_1 + V_2\">V_1 + V_2</span> and measure <span data-math=\"0.3\\,\\text{A}\">0.3\\,\\text{A}</span> of current through resistor <span data-math=\"R_1\">R_1</span>. You add a third battery with <span data-math=\"V_3 = 9.0\\,\\text{V}\">V_3 = 9.0\\,\\text{V}</span> in series with the first two batteries so that the voltage across <span data-math=\"R_1\">R_1</span> is <span data-math=\"V_1 + V_2 + V_3\">V_1 + V_2 + V_3</span> and measure <span data-math=\"0.4\\,\\text{A}\">0.4\\,\\text{A}</span> of current through <span data-math=\"R_1\">R_1</span>. What is the resistance of <span data-math=\"R_1\">R_1</span>?",
   "answers": [
